nsform=\"translate(389,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1540.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2808.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4884.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5273.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6425.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7692.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(8081.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"7D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-7D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> exhibits temperature-dependent magnetic behaviour (paramagnetic/diamagnetic). The coordination geometries of Ni<sup>2+</sup> in the paramagnetic and diamagnetic states are, respectively,</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"tetrahedral and tetrahedral."},{"identifier":"B","content":"square planar and square planar."},{"identifier":"C","content":"tetrahedral and square planar."},{"identifier":"D","content":"square planar and tetrahedral."}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>The configuration of Ni = 3d<sup>8</sup> 4s<sup>2</sup> and that of Ni<sup>2+</sup> = 3d<sup>8</sup>.</p>\n<p>In paramagnetic state, the hybridisation is sp<sup>3</sup> and geometry is tetrahedral.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Coordination Compounds Question 34 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l2659rcs/fed4798c-0c3b-49c7-b1a5-5aa7ea33c595/5dabb8b0-bfdf-11ec-927e-3394d6caf310/file-1l2659rct.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>In diamagnetic state, the hybridisation is dsp<sup>2</sup> and geometry is square planar.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Coordination Compounds Question 34 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l265c20u/c4a79ef7-dcb3-43fe-8e8e-6ee008d86333/9d87d5e0-bfdf-11ec-951c-b3a14118c73b/file-1l265c20v.png?format=png 2000w, https: